sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 已登录用户
    participant Platform as 交易平台
    User->>Platform: GET /api/user/profile
    Platform-->>User: 返回本人资料
    User->>Platform: PUT /api/user/profile
    Platform-->>User: 返回保存结果
    User->>Platform: POST /api/user/addresses
    Platform-->>User: 地址新增成功
    User->>Platform: GET /api/user/addresses
    Platform-->>User: 返回本人地址列表
    User->>Platform: PUT/DELETE /api/user/addresses/{addressId}
    Platform-->>User: 返回修改/删除结果
